data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"parts": [{"text": "**Clarifying Answer Structure**\n\nI'm now completely focused on structuring each sub-answer according to the specifications within Pièce 9. I've confirmed I must address four mandatory elements for each of the four sub-questions, which leads to ~135-145 words available per sub-question. This strict constraint necessitates extreme precision and conciseness. I am now beginning to design the scientific content for Pièce 9, with a focus on Q1 (Usage), and an assertion: **À la portée de ce que l'équipe affirme** (external validity / OOD generalization).\n\n\n","thought": true}],"role": "model"},"index": 0}],"usageMetadata": {"promptTokenCount": 1130,"totalTokenCount": 2402,"promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT","tokenCount": 1130}],"thoughtsTokenCount": 1272,"serviceTier": "standard"},"modelVersion": "gemini-4-carbon","responseId": "ROsCa8euM72FytMPl7SawQM"}

